{
  "changelog": "Initial release of SAR sea ice type and concentration mapping.\n\n- Classifies sea ice into open water, young ice, and multi-year ice from SAR \u03c3\u2070 imagery using multi-class Otsu thresholding on a dB scale.\n- Refines multi-year ice detection with GLCM texture analysis; adapts thresholds for summer conditions.\n- Calculates ice concentration via sliding window analysis.\n- Supports both real SAR \u03c3\u2070 GeoTIFF and auto-generated synthetic data.\n- Outputs include GeoTIFFs for ice type and concentration, JSON statistics, and a run manifest.\n- Runs fully offline; no user data is uploaded.",
